@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

autonumber

Bob -> App : Add the tunes he plays to his Repertoire
Alice -> App : Add the tunes she plays to her Repertoire
Bob -> App : Create a Set (named, ordered Tunes, known to him or not)
Bob -> App : Ask for advice to build the Set to play with Alice (one or more partners)\noptionally filtered by Dance type (default: the Set's) and key
App -> App : Take the Tunes in the partners' Repertoires, not already in the Set\nRank by number of partners who play each Tune, then by name
Bob <-- App : Matching Tunes, each marked "you play it" or "you don't yet"
Bob -> App : Pick one and add it to his Set
Bob -> App : Share the Set with Alice (she adds the same Set by reference, no copy)
@enduml
